{
  "name": "building-menu-visual",
  "description": "Visual check of building selection menu: open build types, place multiple buildings, list placed buildings, inspect scores and state",
  "steps": [
    {
      "command": "new_game seed:42 cash:100000",
      "timeout": 30,
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "new_game seed:42 cash:100000"
        }
      ],
      "role": "setup",
      "description": "cash:100000 belongs on `new_game` here, not on a `campaign start`: this scenario never enters a campaign level, so `new_game` is the only step that decides cash (world.ts passes `cash:` through as `startingCash`). $100,000 covers all six buildings below ($10,000 + $8,000 + $12,000 + $20,000 + $15,000 + $18,000 = $83,000) and leaves the balance above every individual cost along the way, so every buy button in the catalog stays enabled and each placement is a click a real player could make.",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 100000,
          "buildingCount": 0
        },
        "note": "the cash: override replaces the sandbox's $50,000 default outright"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build types",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build types"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "build list",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build list"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "build living_quarters at:5,5",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-toolbar [data-panel=\"build\"]"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"living_quarters\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 5,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 90000,
          "buildingCount": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build management_office at:10,5",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"management_office\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 10,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 82000,
          "buildingCount": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build driving_center at:15,5",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"driving_center\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 15,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 70000,
          "buildingCount": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build explosive_warehouse at:20,5",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"explosive_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 20,
          "z": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 50000,
          "buildingCount": 4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build freight_warehouse at:5,10",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"freight_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"freight_warehouse\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 5,
          "z": 10
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "description": "Was an unmarked command step that reached cash -$15,000: the Build panel disables a buy button on `cash < def.constructionCost` (BuildMenu.ts) so no click could place this, while the console `build` command overdrew happily. The console now refuses an unaffordable build too, and with the level funded at $100,000 there is $35,000 in hand against a $15,000 warehouse — the button is enabled and this is a genuine player click. The awaitUsable ahead of it is the affordability assertion: an underfunded run fails here instead of quietly overdrawing.",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 35000,
          "buildingCount": 5
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build vehicle_depot at:10,10",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "awaitUsable",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"vehicle_depot\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-build-panel [data-build-type=\"vehicle_depot\"] .bs-build-buy-btn"
        },
        {
          "type": "waitForSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        },
        {
          "type": "pickTile",
          "x": 10,
          "z": 10
        },
        {
          "type": "screenshot"
        },
        {
          "type": "clickSelector",
          "selector": "#bs-tile-select-confirm"
        }
      ],
      "role": "player",
      "description": "The second former overdraw step, converted the same way: $35,000 in hand against an $18,000 depot, so the catalog row is enabled and the click lands. Cash stays positive through the whole build-out, which is the point of funding the scenario instead of letting the console overdraw.",
      "expect": {
        "equals": {
          "cash": 17000,
          "buildingCount": 6
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "build list",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build list"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "scores",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "scores"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    },
    {
      "command": "state full",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "state full"
        }
      ],
      "role": "observe"
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "overview",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 45
    },
    {
      "name": "menu-panel",
      "yaw": 90,
      "pitch": 10
    },
    {
      "name": "birdseye",
      "yaw": 0,
      "pitch": 80
    }
  ]
}
